---An `SpotAnimType` config contains the descriptive data necessary for the game to construct a `SpotAnimEntity`.
---
---These config types can be found within the `config.SpotAnim` table:
---
---Info: A `SpotAnimType` is a Proxy usertype, which means it is safe to copy and store in your scripts. It cannot,
---however, be used with any persistent storage.
---
---Information available within an `SpotAnimType` includes:
---@class SpotAnimType
---@field id integer (Read-only) The ID of this config type.
---@field configName string (Read-only) The name of this config, i.e. `"TELEGRAB_IMPACT"`.
---@field typeName string (Read-only) The type of this config. Will always be `"SpotAnim"`.
---@field seqID integer (Read-only) The ID of the SeqType to play with this spotanim.
